  "claim": "Scotty T was the star from the European version of Jersey Shore who was also on Ex on the Beach.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Ex on the Beach (series 4). Sentence: The fourth series of \"Ex on the Beach\", a British television programme, began airing on 19 January 2016 on MTV.\nPage: Ex on the Beach (series 4). Sentence: The series concluded on 8 March 2016 after eight episodes.\nPage: Ex on the Beach (series 4). Sentence: The group of cast members for this series include \"Geordie Shore\" star Scotty T, and \"Judge Geordie\" guest Lewis Good.\nPage: Geordie Shore. Sentence: Geordie Shore is a British reality television series broadcast on MTV and based in Newcastle upon Tyne, England.\nPage: Geordie Shore. Sentence: It was first broadcast on 24 May 2011, and is the British version of the American show \"Jersey Shore\". \"",
